WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.780
Okay. That's all for today.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.370
It's finally over!

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.370
All right. Let's go home.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.160
Sounds good.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.460
Let's go, Riku-kun.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.540
Okay.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:49.750
I'm so sorry!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.210
May I have a minute?

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.250
Is it another event?

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:54.760
Aoba-kun.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.420
Right.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.180
Ummm... I wish it wasn't so sudden, but...

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.640
Aoba-kun will be transferring to another school at the end of the month.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:06.560
That...

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.560
Riku-kun's...

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.610
Transferring?!

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:12.610
Hey, Sayuri!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.440
Sayuri...

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.570
Um...

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:23.950
Because of my father's job, I have to transfer to another school.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.870
Thank you for getting along with me so well.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.960
Aoba-kun...

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:42.010
An Exciting Farwell

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.930
Riku-kun! How could you?!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.560
Aoba! Tell us it's not true!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.140
I'm sorry.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.150
But why is this happening all of a sudden?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.480
Well...

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.400
It wasn't that easy for my parents to tell me this time.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.360
That's why...

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.610
I see.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.320
But we'll miss you.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.160
Yeah. We were getting along so well with each other.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.240
Yeah.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:13.380
AOBA! I won't know what to do without you!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.500
Riku-kun! Don't leave us!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.260
Doujima-kun.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:20.550
Yuusuke.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.600
H-Hey! Sayuri!

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.560
Hey, wait!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.020
Sayuri.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.730
What's wrong with you?

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.150
I... I...

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.280
I don't know what to do anymore!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.990
Sayuri!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.370
Amamiya-kun?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.910
Wait, Sayuri!

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.330
Sakurai-kun.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:56.210
No running in the hall<i>!</i>

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.290
Shiina-san.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.500
Did something happen?

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.040
Actually...

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.550
I know!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.510
Let's have a farewell party for Aoba-kun!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:06.100
Good idea!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:10.850
Yeah. It'll be too sad to say goodbye without doing something for him.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:12.600
E-Everyone...

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.350
Riku-kun!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.520
Geez. Stop crying. Be a man!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.360
Ugh...

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:23.820
Yeah. We have to think of what we can do for Aoba-kun. We shouldn't be crying right now.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.780
That's right.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.580
You're right!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.580
Yeah.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.370
We have to be strong.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.580
Thank you, everyone.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:34.750
Riku-kun!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:36.920
Kasuga-san.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.340
What's wrong?

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.590
Are you really going to transfer to another school?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.140
I didn't hear anything about it.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.140
Riku-kun.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:58.770
Kasuga-san.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.950
Hey, Riku-kun.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:16.370
What's wrong?

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.760
I'd like to go to the beach.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.390
I guess I can't.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.680
Kasuga-san.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:34.180
Bus Stop. Public Beach. Timetable

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.310
Bus Stop

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.310
Seaside

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.310
Timetable

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.450
There's no one here.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:49.620
Yeah.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:54.370
The ocean looks really lonely this time of year.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.210
It was much livelier in the summer, but...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.000
You're right.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.710
Hey, do you remember?

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.170
We came to the beach once. Just the two of us.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.130
Take that, Riku-kun!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.510
Kasuga-san! Cut it out!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.680
Riku-kun! You're so uncool!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.310
Kasuga-san! Now you've done it!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.980
You started it!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.940
But you really WERE uncool!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.740
After that, I thought that I could be alone with you, but...

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:32.070
Somehow, everyone was there, and I didn't know what to do.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:37.580
Perhaps it's our destiny to be separated.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.670
Oh, no. You're exaggerating.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:43.290
But you were so obsessed with Amamiya-san back then.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.750
Th-That's...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.880
You see?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.050
But I did some bad things too.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.890
I don't care about that anymore.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:56.520
Yeah.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.790
What's wrong?

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.000
Kasuga-san?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.340
I can't hold it in anymore.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.600
I love you, Riku-kun.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.430
K-Kasuga-san...

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.730
How do you feel about me?

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.150
On the day when you're going to transfer to another school...

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.240
At the place where we first met...

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.110
I'll be waiting for you there.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.470
You're destined to be my man!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.350
How do you feel about me?

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:36.740
Kasuga-san.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:39.870
But...

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:49.500
A message?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.480
Negotiation Techniques

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.480
Pet
Encyclopedia

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.480
The Illusionary
Symphonies

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.480
Relaxation Techniques

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.480
Rainbow-colored Script

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.480
Dream
Music

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:29.840
Aoba-kun...

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:34.010
Tokimeki      Memorial

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:44.430
It's been a while. Won't you please come and see me train tomorrow?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.480
I'll be waiting for you after school at the pool.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:52.690
All right, Yayoi.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:53.900
Come out and take a break.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:54.990
Okay.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.490
Good work.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.120
Riku-san! You came!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.670
You're training hard today.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.130
Oh... yes.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.960
Do you have some time after your training?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.970
We need to talk.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:18.760
Yes.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:30.270
It's been a while since I saw you training like this.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.150
Oh... yes.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.440
It's been a whole year.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:35.900
Time really does fly.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.110
Mina-chan?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:40.700
Mina-chan.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.540
Um... well...

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.750
Mina-chan, the truth is...

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:47.910
Riku-san.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:54.800
I-I would like to go somewhere with you now...

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.130
O-Okay.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.620
The dolphins are so pretty.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:34.460
But anyway, I never expected there to be an aquarium here.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:35.920
I never knew.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.210
I heard that you're going to transfer to another school.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:44.930
I see.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.930
I guess I won't be able to coach you anymore.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.730
I...

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.190
I don't want to let things end like this!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.780
M-Mina-chan.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:09.120
I'm a coward, and I've got no self-confidence.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.410
But I love swimming.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:17.960
I thought that if I practiced a lot, I'd gain some self-confidence...

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.590
Then I'd be able to tell you how I really felt.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:27.550
But in the end, I couldn't say anything.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.060
That's why I came here.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.980
I thought that I'd be able to gain some courage if I came here.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:47.820
I'll be all right.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:49.620
Riku-san.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.330
I love you.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.090
On the day you transfer, at Tsumugino Shrine,

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.300
please tell me how you really feel about me then.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.840
I'll be waiting for you.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.010
Mina-chan.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.530
What on earth am I doing?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:57.810
Tsumugino High School. Graduation Ceremony

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.610
Congratulations on Graduating!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:11.490
Only place I could think of

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:11.740
Tsumugino High School. Graduation Certificate Ceremony

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.130
Take care

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.130
Aoba Riku-kun
It's a little early, but

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.130
Congratulations on Graduating from Tsumugino High School<i>!!</i>

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.130
Don't forget about us! Take care! See you again!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:22.130
From all of us in class 2-A

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:24.590
Now then, even though Aoba-kun's going to another school, let us pray for his well-being!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.840
Cheers!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:30.840
Um...

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:34.350
Thanks for doing all this for me, everyone.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.060
Hey, Aoba-kun.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.440
Do we have to say farewell today?

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:39.850
Are you really going away?

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:44.860
Yeah. I'll come by tomorrow to say my final farewells, and then...

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.030
I see.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.400
Tomorrow's our graduation day.

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.740
It's a year before our real graduation ceremony.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:52.990
Now, now.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.950
Don't be so depressed.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.040
That's right.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.080
If things stay like this, Aoba-kun won't be able to relax at his new school.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.540
Okay. Let's party!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:02.630
AOBA!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.800
I'm gonna drink till I drop today!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:05.920
Y-Yeah.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.590
Please be gentle.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.680
Why you! How dare you...

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.190
Riku,  you'll always be a good and an important friend.

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.710
Oh nooooo!!

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:33.470
Still not looking like a bird at all.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.630
Amamiya-san!

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:51.930
AOBA!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.930
You're my bosom friend!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:57.470
D-D-D-D-Doujima-kun!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.680
Oh, they're really going at it.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.980
Huh? Amamiya-kun?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:50.780
Farewell, Aoba-kun!

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:52.650
Hold it right there!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.280
What's wrong? You're in such a rush.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.290
Um...

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.210
Do you really want to leave this here?

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:06.830
B-But...

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.080
I also...

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.630
How long do you think I've been here?

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.670
This is important to you, isn't it?

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:14.220
Here.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.090
Amamiya-san.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.510
NOOO!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.640
See? You caught it.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.100
It must be important to you.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:32.190
Well, I don't know what happened, but if you throw it away so easily, you're gonna regret it.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.110
Hoshino-sensei.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.000
This really is goodbye.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:54.630
What's wrong, Aoba-kun?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.220
Sakurai-kun.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.180
You're leaving tomorrow, or so I heard.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:04.600
Yeah.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.270
I see.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.140
I'll miss you.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:14.440
You know, maybe you're mistaken about something.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.780
About Amamiya-kun and me.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.410
You saw us together before, didn't you?

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:20.370
At the church.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:22.410
How did you know?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.490
I knew it.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.160
I was just tasting her chocolate.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.920
She asked me to help her with that.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:30.880
But...

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:35.010
Anyway, this year flew by in an instant.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:38.050
But you've been such a big help.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.300
I was just getting chased all over the place.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.350
But you enjoyed it more than you expected to, right?

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:45.680
Well, that's true too.

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.810
I've done everything I could do as the Student Council President.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:53.900
But what about you?

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.320
Is there anything you wished you'd done while you were here?

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:04.490
Aoba! There you are!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.540
You're the guest of honor! How dare you skip out on your own farewell party?!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.200
C'mon, Riku-kun. Hurry up.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.670
Hey, wait!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.130
Everyone!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.290
Oh, boy.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.420
We were interrupted, even here.

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:18.170
Oh well.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:23.430
Now all that's left is my final trap.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.370
He's leaving tomorrow.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:56.040
Contemporary Valentine's Day

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.260
Riku-kun.

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:20.650
It's so cute!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.360
Thank you so much, Aoba-san.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.280
I'll treasure this.

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:29.540
Oh, no. It's not that special.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.090
Riku-san.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:54.480
Is there anything you wished you'd done while you were here?

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.410
Something I wish I had done?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:10.740
Now I understand, Sakurai-kun.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:26.260
I won't be able to see him after tomorrow.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:37.770
Will you really be okay with things the way they are, Sayuri?

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:46.990
No. I can't let him go away without saying anything to him!

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:52.660
A message?

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:19.900
Sign Says: Tsumugino High School Graduation Ceremony.

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:27.530
My heart is overflowing!

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:42.790
My heart is overflowing!Even if I try to conceal my feelings for you,

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:48.680
I can't help blushing when our eyes meet.

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:57.390
I kept this a secret from my friends,

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:03.820
Because I didn't want to be teased.

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:13.160
The important thing that nobody knows,

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:20.290
I'll only tell to you.

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:25.090
These gently falling flower petals

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:28.670
are sneaking into my heart.

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:35.050
I want to make your heart flutter.

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.640
It's okay to have hopes

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:43.310
for the future we await, right?

